  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mainstream bio-based tourism-UNDP-THA-00118268</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will seek to promote sustainable tourism development in Thailand as a tool to strengthen biodiversity conservation and reduce threats to biodiversity including plastic pollution and climate change. This strategy remains feasible under a COVID-19 context and will capitalize on the opportunity for the government to mainstream biodiversity conservation into its green tourism recovery and resilience strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
