    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1
Indicator 1: Biodiversity-based tourism strategy adopted and integrated into work plans of agencies within the National Tourism Policy Committee 

Indicator 2: National conservation, social and economic impact monitoring methodologies used at project sites
(a) Total
(b) METT (Conservation)
(c) Visitor Use Management Framework (VUMF) (Social) 
(d) Visitors Count! (Economic)
(e) Natural Capital Accounting (Economic)
(f) Payment for Ecosystem Services (Economic)

Indicator 3: # of tourism standards integrating biodiversity conservation

Indicator 4: Improved institutional capacity for mainstreaming biodiversity conservation into tourism planning, management and monitoring, measured by UNDP capacity development scorecard

Outcome 2
Indicator 1: Strategic environmental and social assessment (SESA), tourism masterplan, and gender-responsive biodiversity-based tourism action plan finalized. 
(a) Total
(b) SESA for Prachuap Khiri Khan project landscape
(c) Tourism masterplan for Prachuap Khiri Khan project landscape
(d) Biodiversity-based tourism action plan Prachuap Khiri Khan project landscape

Indicator 2: Visitor management plans finalized for project sites: Kui Buri NP; Khao Sam Roi Yot KNP; Pran Buri Estuary

indicator 3: Improvements in biodiversity, waste management and human wildlife conflict in the project landscape
(a) # Fishing cats 
(b) # waterbird species in Khao Sam Roi Yot wetland
(b1) # Individual bird count of Manchurian Reed Warbler (Acrocephalus tangorum)
(b2) # Individual bird count of Malay Plover (Charadrius peronii)
(c) # reports HWC with fishing cat
(d) # reports HWC with elephant

Indicator 4:
# of certified tourism ventures that are supporting biodiversity criteria in the project sites.
(a) Total
(b) Homestay/ CBT
(c) # Hotel/resorts
(d) # tour operators

Outcome 3
Indicator 1: Knowledge Attitudes and Practices (KAP) of tourism industry, communities and tourists for the importance of biodiversity to tourism improved, as measured by the</narrative>
